    "detailed_description": "Jumping Frog -A Time Traveller- is a first-person exploratory jumping action game.<br><br>The game is an exhilarating game in which the player controls a robot that can jump to high altitudes and repeatedly ascends and descends through stages with many elevation differences.<br><br>Collect the four items in the stage to reach the goal.<br><br>[Features]<br><br>\u30fbFeel great (Jump! Drop! Jump!)<br><br>\u30fbSimple rules (Collect the 4 items to reach the goal ! )<br><br>\u30fb15 unique stages in all (including 5 boss stage)<br><br>\u30fbSupports game controllers. (Xbox360,PS4,etc.)<br><br>\u30fbHigh score recording feature.<br><br>\u30fbSimple 3D design reminiscent of the 1990s.<br><br>\u30fbThis game can be played on computers that do not have high specs.<br>(Playable with on-board graphics(integrated graphics))<br><br>[MISC]<br><br>\u30fbIt is not a vast game, as it is developed by one person.<br><br>\u30fbThis game may have some parts that are not perfect.<br><br>\u30fbWe would appreciate your support :)",
